              "subject": "[PATCH 5/5] x86/paravirt: Trace contended_release on unlock",
              "date": "2026-08-04T07:16:19Z"
            }
          ],
          "series_items": [],
          "patch_summary": "This patch optimizes the unlock path for PARAVIRT_SPINLOCKS=y kernels by swapping the target of a static_call() to a traced unlock when the contended_release tracepoint is enabled. This reduces overhead when tracing is disabled, as it avoids a branch that would otherwise be taken even if tracing is off. The patch also introduces two new traced unlock variants and updates the pv_is_native_spin_unlock function accordingly.",
          "analysis_source": "llm-chunked-no-replies",
          "review_comments": [],
          "list_id": "kvm@vger.kernel.org"
        },
