              "subject": "[PATCH 0/5] locking/qspinlock: Add contended_release tracepoint",
              "date": "2026-08-04T07:16:16Z"
            }
          ],
          "series_items": [],
          "patch_summary": "This patch adds a contended_release tracepoint to the qspinlock locking mechanism, allowing for attribution of contended spinlocks to their holders. The patch combines contention check, trace call, and release into an out-of-line function to minimize overhead. It also introduces a new configuration option to enable or disable this feature. The patch aims to provide more detailed information about lock contention in the Linux kernel.",
          "analysis_source": "llm-chunked-no-replies",
          "review_comments": [],
          "list_id": "kvm@vger.kernel.org"
        },
